<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Sakari</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Sakari bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Sakari</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sak</para>
  <para style="mt">Annabi Sakari xa Kitaabui</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala naxa Annabi Sakari xɛɛ Darisalamu Perise mangɛ Dariyusi xa waxati. Isirayilakae nu bara ɲɛ tongo solofere raba konyiya kui Perise bɔxi ma e xa kuye batui xa fe ra, kɔnɔ Ala naxa a niya Dariyusi xa e bɛɲin gbilenfe ra Isirayila bɔxi ma. E to mɛnni li e xa taae nun Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira banxi birin nu bara kana. E naxa wali suxu nee yailanfe ra, kɔnɔ e yaxuie naxa e tɔɔrɔ. Na kui Ala naxa Annabi Sakari nun Annabi Hage xɛɛ Darisalamu alako e xa Isirayilakae ralimaniya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Sakari xa masenyi fɔlɔma laamatunyi solomasaxan nan ma, naxee a masenma a Ala fama nɛ Isirayilakae malide e xa wali kui. A man a masenma a Ala fama nɛ sie ɲaxankatade naxee na a xa ɲama tɔɔrɔfe. Ala limaniya fima nɛ a xa mixie ma Annabi Sakari xa masenyi saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila xa xunnakeli mu findima fe fanyi ra e tan gbansan bɛ. Duniɲa na a to Ala mɛɛnima Isirayila ma ki naxɛ, e fan danxaniyama nɛ Ala ma, e bira Isirayilakae fɔxɔ ra. Ala Isirayilaka nde rakelima naxan misaalima sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi ra. Na xɛmɛ findima Isirayila mangɛ xungbe nan na, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi, naxan e xun tima Ala xa kira ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi saatɛ Ala naxan tongoxi Isirayila bɛ a findima nɛ lɔnni belebele ra to mixie bɛ. Ala wama nɛ duniɲa birin xa bira a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, e xa la Ala xa xanunteya ra alako e xa kisi sɔtɔ. Xa a sa li adamadie tondima Ala xa mali ra, e sare ɲaaxi sɔtɔma nɛ e ɲɛrɛ ki xa fe ra. Ala wama mixi rakisife. Na nan a ra a naxa Marakisima xɛɛ won ma alako lanyi xa lu Alatala nun adama tagi. Ala xa na sɔɔnɛya won birin bɛ, won fan xa tin na ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Sakari xa Kitaabui</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi singe: Gbilenfe Ala ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde kike solomasaxan nde kui, Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Sakari bɛ, Bɛrɛkaya xa di, Ido xa mamadi fanyi, a naxɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />«Alatala bara xɔnɔ wo benbae ma. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Kɔnɔ, i xa a fala, Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: ‹N tan Mangɛ Alatala bara a fala wo bɛ, wo xa gbilen n ma. Na tɛmui n fan gbilenma nɛ wo ma. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Wo naxa lu alɔ wo benbae. Singe namiɲɔnmɛe nu bara a masen e bɛ, «Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, wo gbilen wo xa fe ɲaaxie nun wo xa kɛwali ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra.» Kɔnɔ e mu e tuli mati n ma masenyi ra, e mu n xui suxu. N tan Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Wo benbae na minden? Namiɲɔnmɛe go? E mu faxama xɛ? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />N ma masenyi nun n ma sɛriyɛ, a mu wo benbae lixi?›»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">A to gɛ na masenyi ra, ɲama naxa tuubi, e fa a fala e boore bɛ, «Mangɛ Alatala bara won ma fe rabaxie sare ragbilen won ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Kike fu nun keren nde xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nde, Sebati kike, Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde, Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Sakari bɛ, Bɛrɛkaya xa di, Ido xa mamadi, <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />«To kɔɛ ra n bara yi laamatunyi to. Xɛmɛ nde nu na soe gbeeli fari, a nu tixi miriti wurie tagi fole kui. Soe gbeelie, soe fɔɔrɛe, nun soe fiixɛe nu na a xanbi ra. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />N naxa a maxɔrin, ‹N Marigi, munse na yee tan na?› Malekɛ naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, a naxa a fala, ‹N a masenma nɛ i bɛ.› <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Mixi naxan nu tixi miriti wurie tagi, a naxa a fala, ‹Alatala xa xɛɛrae nan e ra naxee duniɲa iɲɛrɛma.› <verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />E naxa dɛntɛgɛ sa Alatala xa malekɛ bɛ naxan nu tixi miriti wurie tagi, ‹Muxu bara duniɲa birin iɲɛrɛ, duniɲa mixi birin raxaraxi, e na bɔɲɛsa kui.› <verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Alatala xa malekɛ naxa a fala, ‹Mangɛ Alatala, i fama kinikinide Darisalamu nun Yudaya xa taae ma mun tɛmui? I xɔnɔxi e ma kabi ɲɛ tongo solofere.› <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Alatala naxa na malekɛ ralimaniya, a a madundu, malekɛ naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na.»<verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />«Na malekɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹I xa a fala, Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Darisalamu nun Siyon rafan n ma. N mu tinma e xa bira xanuntenyi gbɛtɛ fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />N bara xɔnɔ si gbɛtɛe ma naxee ɲɔxɔ a ma tɔɔrɛ yo mu nɔma e lide. Singe n nu xɔnɔxi dondoronti n ma ɲama ma, kɔnɔ sie tan bara nde sa n ma ɲama xa tɔɔrɛ xun ma.›»<verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />«Na nan a ra, Alatala naxa a masen, ‹N man kinikinima nɛ Darisalamu ma, n man n ma banxi tima nɛ. Luuti ibɛndunma nɛ Darisalamu taa xun ma alako na xa maniya, na taa man xa gbilen ti ra.› Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki. <verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />I man xa a fala, ‹Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Harige man luma n ma taae kui, n man Siyon madundu ma nɛ, n man Darisalamu sugandima nɛ.›»<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi firin nde: Ferie nun xabuie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />N naxa yi laamatunyi to: N bara feri naani to. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />N bara malekɛ maxɔrin, naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, «Munse na yee ra?» A naxa n yaabi, «Sɛnbɛmae nan yee ra naxee Yudaya, Isirayila, nun Darisalamu rayensenxi.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Na tɛmui, Alatala naxa xabui naani masen n bɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />N naxa maxɔrinyi ti, «Yee faxi munse rabade be?» A naxa n yaabi, «Yi feri naani misaalixi sɛnbɛmae nan na naxee Yudaya rayensenxi mixi yo mu nɔ a xunyi rakelide. Kɔnɔ yi xabuie faxi e magaaxude nɛ, e si gbɛtɛ sɛnbɛmae rabira, naxee kelixi Yudaya bɔxi xili ma alako e xa Yudayakae rayensen.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi saxan nde: Maniya luuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />N naxa yi laamatunyi to: Xɛmɛ nde nu na, maniya luuti nu suxuxi a yi ra. <verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />N naxa a maxɔrin, «I siga minden?» A naxa n yaabi, «N Darisalamu nan maniyafe, alako n xa a gboe nun a kuyɛya kolon.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />Malekɛ naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, a naxa siga yare, malekɛ gbɛtɛ naxa fa a ralande. <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, «I gi, sa a fala yi sɛgɛtala bɛ, a Darisalamukae nun xurusee fama nɛ wuyade han tɛtɛ mu nɔ e rabilinde sɔnɔn.» <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: «N tan yati e makantama nɛ. N luma nɛ e bɛ alɔ tɛtɛ tɛ daaxi, n ma nɔrɛ fa lu e tagi.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">«Wo wo gi, wo wo gi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Wo xa keli ɲamanɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">naxan na kɔɔla ma.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">«Singe n nu bara wo rayensen yɛ duniɲa ma.<verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />Siyon mixie, wo wo gi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:11">Wo tan naxee na Babilɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:11">wo xa keli naa.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />Mangɛ Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">a naxan xɛɛxi binyɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">fe falafe yi sie xa fe ra naxee wo tɔɔrɔxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">«Naxan a bɛlɛxɛ dinma wo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">a luxi nɛ alɔ na kanyi bara a bɛlɛxɛ din Ala ra.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />N na keli e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">e findi e xa konyie xa konyie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">a Mangɛ Alatala nan n xɛɛxi.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:14" />«Darisalamukae, wo wo xui ite sɛɛwɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">barima n fama nɛ lude wo tagi.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ZEC 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:15" />Si wuyaxi fama nɛ Alatala ma na lɔxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">e fa findi n ma ɲama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">N luma nɛ wo tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">wo fa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">a Mangɛ Alatala nan n xɛɛxi wo ma.<verse eid="ZEC 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:16" />Yudaya man findima Alatala gbe nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:16">a xa bɔxi sɛniyɛnxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:16">A man fama nɛ Darisalamu sugandide.<verse eid="ZEC 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:17" />Adamadi birin xa a sabari Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:17">a na kelife a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi.<verse eid="ZEC 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi naani nde: Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />A naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosuwe masen n bɛ, a nu tixi Alatala xa malekɛ ya i. Sentanɛ nu tixi a yirefanyi ma a xa a tɔɔɲɛgɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />Alatala naxa a fala Sentanɛ bɛ, «N tan, Alatala naxan Darisalamu sugandixi, n bara a fala i bɛ Sentanɛ, i sabari! Yege xuntunyi xa mu na yi xɛmɛ ra naxan baxi tɛ dɛ i?»<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Yosuwe nu tixi malekɛ ya i, dugi nɔxɔxi nan nu ragoroxi a ma. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Malekɛ naxa a fala a booree bɛ naxee nu tixi Yosuwe sɛɛti ma, «Wo dugi nɔxɔxie ba a ma.» A man naxa a fala Yosuwe bɛ, «A mato, n bara i xa yunubi ba, n bara dugi tofanyie ragoro i ma.» <verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />N naxa a fala, «Wo xa xunyi ratofan se sɛniyɛnxi dɔxɔ a xunyi ma.» E naxa xunyi ratofan se sɛniyɛnxi dɔxɔ a xunyi ma, e naxa dugie ragoro a ma. Alatala xa malekɛ nu tixi naa.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Alatala xa malekɛ naxa yi masenyi ti Yosuwe bɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />«Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Xa i ɲɛrɛ n ma kirae xɔn, xa i n ma yaamarie suxu, i fama nɛ n ma banxi raɲɛrɛde, i fa n ma tɛtɛ makantade. Na tɛmui i yire sɔtɔma nɛ be yee tagi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosuwe, i tan nun naxee dɔxɔxi i ya i, wo wo tuli mati. Wo bara findi misaali ra. N fama n ma konyi xɛɛde, naxan xili ‹Salonyi.› <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Wo xa gɛmɛ mato n naxan dɔxɔxi Yosuwe ya i. Ya solofere na na gɛmɛ kerenyi ma. N sɛbɛli tima nɛ a ma, n man fa yi bɔxi xa yunubi ba lɔxɔɛ keren kui.» Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />«Na lɔxɔɛ, wo wo boore xilima nɛ, wo xa lu yire keren wo xa wɛni bili nun xɔrɛ bili bun ma.» Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi suuli nde: Lanpui dɔxɔ se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Malekɛ naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, a naxa fa n naxunude, alɔ e mixi raxunuma ki naxɛ xixɔli ma. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />A naxa n maxɔrin, «I munse toxi?» N naxa a yaabi, «N lanpui dɔxɔ se xɛɛma daaxi nan toxi, bitirɛ na a xuntagi, ture ra a kui. Lanpui solofere gbakuxi a ma, ture gorode solofere, ture rasoma na lanpui soloferee kui. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Oliwi wuri bili firin tixi ture bitirɛ sɛɛti firinyie ma, keren a yirefanyi ma, keren a kɔɔla ma.» <verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />N naxa malekɛ maxɔrin, naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, «N marigi, munse na yee ra?» <verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, «I mu a kolon?» N naxa a yaabi: «N marigi, n mu a kolon.» <verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Na tɛmui a naxa a masen n bɛ, «Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, a naxan tixi Sorobabeli bɛ, ‹Wo sɛnbɛ mu nɔma sese ra. N tan nan Xaxili nɔma a rabade.› Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya.»<verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />«Geya xungbe naxan na Sorobabeli ya ra, n na findima nɛ fiili ra. A fama nɛ gɛmɛ fanyi raminide banxi ti se ra, ɲama fa a fala e xui itexi ra, ‹Ala xa hinnɛ a ra, Ala xa hinnɛ a ra!›»<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti n bɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />«Sorobabeli bara yi banxi ti fɔlɔ, a man a raɲɔnma nɛ.» Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a Mangɛ Alatala nan n xɛɛxi wo yire. <verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />Nde yoma fe fɔlɛ xuri ma? Ɲama na wali se to Sorobabeli bɛlɛxɛ, e ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:10">Malekɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «Na lanpui solofere findixi Alatala yae nan na naxee duniɲa iɲɛrɛma.» <verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />N naxa a maxɔrin a ma, «Munse na na oliwi wuri bili firinyi ra, naxee na lanpui dɔxɔ se yirefanyi ma nun a kɔɔla ma?» <verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />N man naxa a maxɔrin a ma, «Munse na na oliwi salonyi firinyie ra, naxee na ture gorode xɛɛma daaxi firinyie sɛɛti ma, oliwi ture dangima naxee kui?» <verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, «I mu a kolon e naxee misaalixi?» N naxa a yaabi, «N marigi, n mu a kolon.» <verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, «Mixi firin nan e ra Ala naxee sugandixi, a ture ifili e xunyie ma, e xa wali duniɲa birin Marigi bɛ.»<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi senni nde: Dankɛ kɛɛdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />N man naxa laamatunyi to naxan findixi kɛɛdi makuntanxi ra koore ma. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Malekɛ naxa n maxɔrin, «I munse toxi?» N naxa a yaabi, «N kɛɛdi makuntanxi nan toxi koore ma, a kuya nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn, a igbo nɔngɔn ya fu.» <verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, «Dankɛ sɛbɛxi na kɛɛdi ma naxan masenxi bɔxi yire birin. A sɛbɛxi muɲɛti nun mixie nan bɛ, naxee e kalima wule ra, e birin fama nɛ keride yi bɔxi ma. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, ‹N yi dankɛ rasoma nɛ muɲɛtie xa banxie kui, a nun mixi naxee e kalima n xili ra kɔnɔ e fa wule fala. Na dankɛ luma nɛ e xa banxie kui han a birin kana.›»<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi solofere nde: Ginɛ na busali kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Malekɛ naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, a naxa makɔrɛ n na, a fa a fala n bɛ, «A mato naxan na minife yakɔsi.» <verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />N naxa a maxɔrin, «Munse a ra?» A naxa n yaabi, «Busali nan a ra, ɲama xa fe ɲaaxie na naxan kui.» <verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Dɛrakote binye to ba a dɛ ra, a naxa a to ginɛ nde dɔxɔxi a kui. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Malekɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «Fe ɲaaxi misaali nan yi ginɛ ra.» A man naxa ginɛ radin busali kui, a fa a dɛ rakoto dɛrakote binye ra.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />N to n ya rakeli, n naxa ginɛ firin to. Gabutenyi gbongboe daaxie nu na e ma, e nu na ɲɛrɛfe koore ma. E naxa na busali tongo, e a xanin koore ma. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />N naxa malekɛ maxɔrin, naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, «E na busali xaninfe minden?» <verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />A naxa n yaabi, «E na a xaninfe Babilɔn bɔxi nan ma, e banxi tima a bɛ dɛnnaxɛ, a xa lu naa.»<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s">Laamatunyi solomasaxan nde: Sɔɔri ragise naani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />N man naxa laamatunyi to. Sɔɔri ragise naani nu na minife geya firinyie longori ra. Na geyae nu yailanxi yɔxui nan na. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Soe gbeelie nan nu na sɔɔri ragise singe bɛndunfe, soe fɔɔrɛe nan nu na sɔɔri ragise firin nde bɛndunfe, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />soe fiixɛe nan nu na sɔɔri ragise saxan nde bɛndunfe, soe makatunxie nan nu na sɔɔri ragise naani nde bɛndunfe. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />N naxa malekɛ maxɔrin, naxan nu wɔyɛnma n na, «N marigi, munse yee ra?»<verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Malekɛ naxa n yaabi, «Foye naani nan e ra, Duniɲa Marigi na naxee raminife. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Soe fɔɔrɛe sigama ɲamanɛ kɔɔla nan ma, soe fiixɛe sigama ɲamanɛ sogegorode nan ma, soe makatunxie sigama ɲamanɛ yirefanyi nan ma.» <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Yi soe sɛnbɛmae to nu wama sigafe duniɲa iɲɛrɛde, malekɛ nde naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo siga bɔxi iɲɛrɛde.» E naxa keli keren na. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Ala naxa a fala n bɛ a xui itexi ra, «I bara a mato, naxee sigaxi ɲamanɛ kɔɔla ma, e bara n waxɔnfe raba naa.»<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosuwe xa mangɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />«Xeledayi, Tobiya, nun Yɛdaya na fa kelife konyiya kui Babilɔn bɔxi ma, i xa e xa fangadamae rasuxu. Na lɔxɔɛ i xa siga Sofoni xa di Yosiya yire <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />na gbeti nun na xɛɛma ra. I xa mangɛya tɔnxuma rafala na ra, i fa a dɔxɔ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosuwe xun ma, Yehosadaki xa di. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />I xa a fala a bɛ, ‹Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Yi mixi naxan xili «Salonyi.» Na salonyi bulama nɛ, a fa Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />A tan nan Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tima, mangɛya tɔnxuma luma nɛ a yi, a dɔxɔ a xa kibanyi kui, a ɲama yamari. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nde fan dɔxɔma nɛ a xa kibanyi kui. Bɔɲɛsa lu e firinyi tagi.› <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Mangɛya tɔnxuma luma nɛ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui Helemi, Tobiya, Yɛdaya, nun Sofoni xa di Heni yi ra.»<verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />«Mixi naxee makuya, nee fama nɛ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tide. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a Mangɛ Alatala nan n xɛɛxi wo ma. Na birin fama nɛ rabade xa wo wo Marigi Alatala xui suxu a fanyi ra.»<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s">Sunyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ naani nde, Kisilewi kike solomanaani nde, xi naani nde lɔxɔɛ, Alatala naxa masenyi ti Annabi Sakari bɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Betelikae nu bara Sareseri nun Regemi Meleki nun e xa mixie xɛɛ Alatala maxandide. <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />E man xa Mangɛ Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, naxee nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a nun namiɲɔnmɛe maxɔrin, «Muxu lan muxu xa muxu wa xui ramini kike suuli nde ra, muxu xa sunyi suxu alɔ muxu a rabaxi ɲɛ wuyaxie ra ki naxɛ?»<verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Mangɛ Alatala naxa masenyi ti n bɛ yi ki, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />«Ɲama nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛe maxɔrin n bɛ, ‹Wo to nu sunyi suxuma sunnunyi kui na kike suuli ndee nun na kike solofere ndee ɲɛ tongo solofere bun ma, wo nu sunma n tan nan bɛ? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Wo to nu wo dɛgema nun wo wo minma, wo mu a rabaxi wo yɛtɛ xa bɛ? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Alatala mu na masenyi mɔɔli ti a xa namiɲɔnmɛ singee saabui xa ra, Darisalamu nun a rabilinyi nu sabatixi bɔɲɛsa kui tɛmui naxɛ? Na tɛmui, mixie nu na Negewi nun Sefela bɔxi ma.›»<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Alatala naxa masenyi ti Annabi Sakari bɛ yi ki, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />«Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: ‹Wo xa kiiti sa tinxinyi kui. Wo xa hinnɛ wo boore ra kinikini kui. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Wo naxa kaaɲɛ ginɛe, kiridie, bɔxi xɔɲɛe, nun setaree tɔɔrɔ. Wo naxa natɛ ɲaaxi tongo wo bɔɲɛ kui wo booree xa fe ra.› <verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />Kɔnɔ e mu tin na masenyi ra, e naxa e kobe so, e mu e tuli mati na ra. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />E bɔɲɛe naxa xɔrɔxɔ alɔ diyaman, e naxa tondi Mangɛ Alatala xa sɛriyɛ suxude, a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nu bara naxan nasanba namiɲɔnmɛ singee ma. Na nan a ra Mangɛ Alatala naxa xɔnɔ e ma a belebele ra. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />A to e xili, e naxa tondi a xui suxude. Yakɔsi, xa e tan bara a xili, a mu e xa maxandi suxuma de.» Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />«N e rayensen nɛ sie birin ya ma e mu naxee kolon. E to keli e xa bɔxi ma, dɛnnaxɛ nu bara rabɛɲin, mixi yo mu dangima dɛnnaxɛ, mixi yo mu sigama dɛnnaxɛ. Bɔxi fanyi findi gbaloe bɔxi ra e tan nan saabui ra.»<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa laayidi Darisalamu xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />Mangɛ Alatala naxa a masen, «N mu wama n firin nde xɔn Siyon. N ma ɲama xa fe xɔrɔxɔ n ma ki fanyi.» <verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Alatala naxa a masen, «N man fama nɛ Siyon, n xa lu wo tagi Darisalamu. Darisalamu fama nɛ xilide ‹Taa nɔndila.› Mangɛ Alatala xa geya fama nɛ xilide ‹Geya Sɛniyɛnxi.›»<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: «Xɛmɔxie nun ɲɛlɛxɛforie man luma nɛ Darisalamu malan yire, yisuxuwuri suxu e yi e xa simaya xɔnnakuye xa fe ra. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Dimɛdie fan luma nɛ bere ra taa malandee.»<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, «Hali a fa findi tɛrɛnna ra yi waxati ɲama dɔnxɔɛ bɛ, Mangɛ Alatala mu nɔma kaabade na fe ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, «N nan n ma ɲama rakisima nɛ ɲamanɛe ma naxee kelima sogetede nun sogegorode. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />N e ragbilenma nɛ Darisalamu. E findima nɛ n ma ɲama ra, n fan findi e Marigi Ala ra nɔndi nun tinxinyi kui.»<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, «Wo wo sɛnbɛ so, wo tan naxee nu bara yi masenyi mɛ namiɲɔnmɛe saabui ra Mangɛ Alatala xa banxi kɔɔrin tɛmui naxɛ. Wo wo sɛnbɛ so alako yi banxi xa ɲɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Beenu na wali xa fɔlɔ, wali sare yo mu nu na walikɛe bɛ. Hali ningee mu donse sɔtɔ e xa wali kui. Wali birin mu nu nɔma sɔɔnɛyade, barima n nu bara yaxuiɲa ramini mixie tagi. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi n mu yi ɲama dɔnxɔɛ tɔɔrɔma alɔ singe.» Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />«Bɔɲɛsa luma nɛ bɔxi ma. Wɛni bilie bogima nɛ, bɔxi daxamui raminima nɛ, tunɛ ye fama nɛ. N na birin soma nɛ yi ɲama dɔnxɔɛ yi ra e kɛ ra. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Singe Yudaya bɔnsɔɛ nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ findi nɛ dankɛ ra sie tagi, kɔnɔ yakɔsi, n to wo rakisi, wo findima nɛ e bɛ saabui ra e barakɛ sɔtɔ. Wo naxa gaaxu, wo wo sɛnbɛ so.»<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, «Wo benbae to n naxɔnɔ, n naxa natɛ tongo n xa wo ɲaxankata. N mu tin gbilende na natɛ fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi n bara natɛ tongo, n xa fe fanyi raba wo bɛ, Darisalamu nun Yudaya bɔnsɔɛ. Wo naxa gaaxu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Wo xa yi masenyi rabatu: Wo xa nɔndi fala wo boore bɛ, wo xa kiiti sa nɔndi nun tinxinyi kui. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Ɲaaxuiɲa naxa lu wo bɔɲɛ kui wo booree mabiri. Wo naxa wo kali wule kui, barima na fe mɔɔli mu rafan n ma.» Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />«Mangɛ Alatala naxa a masen wo sunyi naxee suxuma kike naani nde, kike suuli nde, kike solofere nde, nun kike fu nde ra, nee xa findi sali sɛɛwɛ daaxie ra. Nɔndi nun bɔɲɛsa xa rafan wo ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, «Mixi gbegbe fama nɛ fade kelife ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe ma. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Mixie luma siga ra yire gbɛtɛ e sa a fala mɛnnikae bɛ, ‹Won xɛɛ Mangɛ Alatala maxandide, won birin na a ra.› <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Sɛnbɛma wuyaxie kelife ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe ma, e fama nɛ Mangɛ Alatala fende Darisalamu, e a maxandi.»<verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, «Na lɔxɔɛe ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe mixi fu fama nɛ kankande Yuwifi keren ma, e fa a fala a bɛ, ‹Won birin na a ra, barima muxu bara a kolon Ala na wo fɛ ma.›»<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s">Si gbɛtɛe xa kiiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Alatala bara masenyi xɔrɔxɔɛ ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Xadaraki xa bɔxi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Na masenyi bara Damasi taa fan li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Alatala gbe nan adamadi birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe fan a gbe.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Na masenyi bara Xamata taa li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">naxan na Damasi naaninyi mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">A bara Tire nun Sidɔn fan li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">hali lɔnnilae nan to e ra.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Tire bara taa makantaxi ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">a xa gbeti bara gbo alɔ mɛyɛnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">a xa xɛɛma bara gbo alɔ boora.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Kɔnɔ Marigi na birin bama nɛ a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">a a xa tɛtɛ radin baa ma, a fa taa gan.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Asikalɔn na na to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">a fan luma nɛ gaaxui kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gasa nun Ekiron fan gaaxuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">e sɛrɛnma nɛ barima e xa xunnakeli bara findi yaagi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gasa mangɛ faxama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">mixi yo mu luma Asikalɔn sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Si masunbuxi fama nɛ sabatide Asidodi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:6">«N Filisitakae xa yɛtɛ igboɲa ragoroma nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />N faxɛ tife ɲɔnma nɛ mɛnni.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ɲama dɔnxɔɛ fama nɛ birade muxu Marigi Ala fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">E sabatima nɛ Yudaya xabilɛe ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ekiron luma nɛ alɔ Yebusu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />«N na n ma banxi kanta ma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">alako sɔɔri gali yo naxa a kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">Naxan fama, naxan dangima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">e mu nɔma sese ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">barima yakɔsi n ɲɛngi saxi a xɔn ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Siyonkae, wo xa ɲɛlɛxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Darisalamukae, wo xa wo xui ite sɛɛwɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Wo xa mangɛ na fafe wo yire.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">A tinxin. A kisixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">A mu a yɛtɛ igboma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">a soma taa kui sofale nan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">sofale xɛmɛma, sofale ginɛma xa di.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />«N sɔɔri ragise bama nɛ Efirami bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">n soee bama nɛ Darisalamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Gereso xalie mu luma naa.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">A bɔɲɛsa nan masenma sie bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">A xa mangɛya xungboma nɛ yire birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">kelife baa xungbe ma, a sa dɔxɔ xure xungbe ra.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />«N bara wo xa mixi suxuxie xun sara</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">won ma saatɛ xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">naxan xirixi sɛrɛxɛ wuli daaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">E nu na fe xɔrɔxɔɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">alɔ mixi naxee ragoroxi kɔlɔnyi nde kui, ye mu na naxan kui.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Wo xa gbilen taa makantaxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">wo tan geelimani naxee xaxili tixi n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">To n xa a fala wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">n wo harige ragbilenma nɛ wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">n man fa a xunmasa.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Yudaya findima nɛ n ma xali ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Efirami luma nɛ alɔ n ma tanbɛe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Siyonikae findima nɛ n ma sɔɔrie ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Girɛkikae xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">N ma santidɛgɛma nan i ra.»<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Alatala a yɛtɛ makɛnɛnma nɛ e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">a xa tanbɛ lu alɔ seyamakɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">Marigi Alatala sara fema nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">a lu alɔ turunnaadɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />Mangɛ Alatala e makantama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">E xa geresosee kanari rabama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">e wuli ifili alɔ sɛrɛxɛdubɛe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">naxan xuruse kɔn naxabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">e fa na wuli kasan sɛrɛxɛbade ma.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />E Marigi Alatala e rakisima nɛ na lɔxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyi a xa xurusee kantama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">Ala xa ɲama luma nɛ alɔ diyaman naxan yanbama bɔxi ma.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />E tofanma nɛ, e rayabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">Baloe fanyi sɛgɛtalae xungboma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">minse fanyie sungbutunyie rayabu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa hinnɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Wo xa Alatala maxandi ɲɛmɛ tɛmui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">Alatala fama nɛ tunɛ belebele ra wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">alako wo xa xɛe xa fan.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Kuyee wule falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">sematoee mu nɔndi toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">e xiyee fasarima wule ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">e xa madundui fufafu na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">Na birin bara a niya ɲama xa lɔɛ alɔ xurusee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">E na tɔɔrɛ kui barima xuruse dɛmadonyi mu na e bɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />N bara xɔnɔ na xuruse dɛmadonyie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">N e xa yareratie ɲaxankatama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Yudaya luma nɛ alɔ Mangɛ Alatala xa xurusee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">a mɛɛnima nɛ e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">E fama nɛ binyɛ sɔtɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">alɔ sɔɔri mangɛ xa soe.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Mixi nde kelima nɛ Yudaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">naxan misaalima gɛmɛ ra banxi tixi naxan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">naxan misaalima wuri ra kiri banxi xirixi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">naxan misaalima xali geresose ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">Mangɛ birin fatanxi Yudaya bɔnsɔɛ nan na.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Yudayakae findima nɛ sɛnbɛmae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">naxee e yaxuie maboronma gere kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">barima Alatala na e fɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">E yaxuie xa soe ragimae luma nɛ yaagi kui.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />«N Yudaya bɔnsɔɛ xun nakelima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">n Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">n e xa taae yailan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">barima n bara kinikini e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">E fama nɛ lude alɔ n mu e rabɛɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">E Marigi Alatala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">n e xa duba suxuma nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ fan findima nɛ sɛnbɛmae ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">E sɛɛwama nɛ dangife siisilae ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">E xa die na birin toma nɛ, e fan ɲɛlɛxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">E birin bɔɲɛ sɛɛwama nɛ Alatala xa fe ra.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />N nan n ma ɲama maxilima nɛ, n xa e xun sara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">e xa wuya dangife singe ra.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Hali n to e rayensenxi sie ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">e e ratuma nɛ n ma fe ma yire makuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">E tan nun e xa die kisima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">e man fa gbilen e xɔnyi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />N e rafama nɛ kelife Misira bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">n e malan kelife Asiriya bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">N man Galadi nun Liban bɔxi fima nɛ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">kɔnɔ e kɔnti dangima nɛ na birin na.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />E xa tɔɔrɛ bara lu alɔ baa mɔrɔnyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">kɔnɔ Ala na mɔrɔnyie ragoroma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Nili xure bara a niya e xa lu konyiya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">kɔnɔ na xure bara xɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Asiriya xa yɛtɛ igboɲa goroma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Misira xa mangɛya ɲɔn.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />N tan nan e sɛnbɛ soma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">e fama nɛ ɲɛrɛde n xili ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="s">Xuruse dɛmadonyie</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Liban bɔxi, i xa wuri birin fama nɛ gande.<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Wo fama nɛ wade wo xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">barima sipirɛ, sɛdiri, nun konde bilie fama nɛ birade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">Basan wondi belebele bara kana.<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Xuruse dɛmadonyie wama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">barima fiili bara kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Yɛtɛe xaaɲɛma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">barima Yurudɛn fɔtɔnyi bara kana.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />N Marigi Alatala a masen nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:4">«Wo xa xurusee dɛ madon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:4">naxee fama faxade.<verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Mixi naxee e sarama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">e fama nɛ e kɔn naxabade kinikinitareɲa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">Naxee e matima e a falama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">‹Ala tantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">N bara banna.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">Xuruse dɛmadonyie mu kinikinima e ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">«N fan mu kinikinima yi ɲama ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">N bara e birin lu e boore yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">e xa mangɛ yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">alako ɲama xa ɲaxankata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">N mu mixi yo ratangama na ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Na kui n naxa xurusee tɔɔrɔxi dɛ madon, naxee nu lanxi e xa faxa. N naxa yisuxuwuri firin tongo. N naxa keren xili sa «Hinnɛ,» boore «Lanyi.» N naxa xurusee dɛ madon. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />N naxa xuruse dɛmadonyi saxan keri kike keren bun, barima e mu rafanxi n ma sɔnɔn, n fan mu rafanxi e ma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />N naxa a fala xurusee bɛ, «N mu wo dɛ madonma sɔnɔn. Naxan lan a xa faxa, a xa faxa. Naxan lan a xa siga, a xa siga. Naxan lan a xa lu be, a xa a boore faxa.» <verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />N naxa n ma yisuxuwuri tongo naxan xili «Hinnɛ,» n naxa a igira. Na misaalixi saatɛ nan na naxan xirixi n tan nun sie birin tagi. Na saatɛ bara kana. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />N to na kana xurusee tɔɔrɔxi ya xɔri, e naxa a kolon n nu bara Alatala xa masenyi fala. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />N naxa a fala e bɛ, «Xa a wo kɛnɛn, wo n ma wali sare fi n ma, xa na mu a ra wo a lu na.» E naxa kɔbiri kole tongo saxan fi n ma wali sare ra. <verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, «Xa e n ma wali tide toma na ki nɛ, a sare mu gbo, a wɔlɛ. Fɛɲɛ yailanma xa na tongo.» N naxa na kɔbiri kole tongo saxan tongo, n naxa e wɔlɛ Alatala xa banxi kui mixi nde bɛ naxan fɛɲɛe yailanma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa n ma yisuxuwuri igira naxan nu xili «Lanyi,» barima lanyi mu na Yudaya nun Isirayila tagi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, «I man xa xuruse dɛmadonyi xaxilitare xa walisee tongo. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />N xuruse dɛmadonyi rakelima nɛ yi bɔxi ma naxan mu a ɲɛngi sama xurusee xɔn ma. Xa xuruse keren bara lɔɛ, a mu sigama a fende. Xa keren bara maxɔnɔ, a mu a dandanma. Xa keren bara xungbo fɔlɔ, a a sube birin donma nɛ han a a tore li.»<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />«Ɲaxankatɛ na xuruse dɛmadonyi ɲaaxi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">naxan xurusee rabɛɲinma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Santidɛgɛma xa a bɛlɛxɛ sɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">a xa a ya sɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">A bɛlɛxɛ naxa nɔ fefe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">a ya naxa fe yo to.»<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s">Yudaya xa xunnakeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Alatala bara masenyi xɔrɔxɔɛ ti Isirayila xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:1">Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:1">naxan koore nun bɔxi daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:1">naxan xaxili so adamadi yi ra:<verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />«N fe xungbe rabama nɛ Darisalamu bɛ, duniɲa sie tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:2">Mixi na fa Darisalamu gerede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:2">n kaabanako rabama nɛ Yudaya bɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Na lɔxɔɛ, n Darisalamu findima nɛ gɛmɛ binye ra si birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:3">Naxan katama na itefe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:3">na kanyi maxɔnɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:3">Duniɲa si birin malanma nɛ a xili ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">«Na lɔxɔɛ, n sɔɔri nun a xa soe radaxuma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">N nee findi dɔnxui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">N Yudaya bɔnsɔɛ matoma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">n nan n ɲɛngi sa e xɔn ma.<verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Yudaya mangɛe a falama nɛ e bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:5">‹Darisalamukae sɛnbɛ gboxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:5">e Marigi Alatala nan saabui ra.›<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />Na lɔxɔɛ, n Yudaya mangɛe luma nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">alɔ tɛ wolenxi yege xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">xa na mu alɔ tɛ na din sɛxɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">E fama nɛ si birin halakide naxan na e rabilinyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">Darisalamu mu kanama.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />Alatala Yudaya taae nan singe rakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:7">alako Dawuda xabilɛ nun Darisalamukae</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:7">xa binyɛ naxa dangi Yudaya mixie ra.<verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala Darisalamukae makantama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">Ala a niyama nɛ mixi taganxi xa Dawuda sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">Dawuda xabilɛ sɛnbɛ gboma nɛ Ala saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">Alatala xa malekɛ a ɲɛrɛma nɛ e ya ra.<verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Na lɔxɔɛ, n si birin halakima nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:9">naxee Darisalamu gerema.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />N hinnɛ nun kinikini luma nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">Dawuda xabilɛ nun Darisalamukae xaxili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">E fama nɛ e ya rafindide n ma, e n tan naxan sɔxɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">E sunnunma nɛ n ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">alɔ mixi naxan xa di singe bara faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">E e wa xui raminima na ki nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Na lɔxɔɛ, sunnunyi gboma nɛ Darisalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:11">alɔ Hadada Rimɔn sunnunxi Megido gulunba kui ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Ɲama birin sunnunma nɛ xabilɛ ki ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">Dawuda xabilɛ luma nɛ a xati ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">Natan xabilɛ fan luma nɛ a xati ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">Xɛmɛe nun ginɛe mu sunnunma yire keren.<verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />Lewi xabilɛ luma nɛ a xati ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:13">Simeyi xabilɛ luma nɛ a xati ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:13">Xɛmɛe nun ginɛe mu sunnunma yire keren.<verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />Xabilɛ birin luma nɛ a xati ma.»<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s">Ɲama sɛniyɛnxi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />Na lɔxɔɛ, dulonyi minima nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:1">naxan nɔma Dawuda xabilɛ nun Darisalamukae</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:1">yunubi bade.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:2">«Na lɔxɔɛ, n kuyee xili bama nɛ wo dɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:2">wo nɛɛmu e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:2">N e xa namiɲɔnmɛe nun e xa sɛniyɛntareɲa kerima nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Xa mixi nde suusama namiɲɔnmɛ masenyi tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">a nga nun a baba naxan a barixi e a falama a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">‹I xa faxa, barima i bara wule fala Alatala xili ra.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">A nga nun a baba naxan a barixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">e a sɔxɔma nɛ na masenyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />Na lɔxɔɛ, namiɲɔnmɛe birin yaagima nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:4">e xa masenyie xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:4">E mu namiɲɔnmɛ dugi ragoroma e ma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:4">alako e xa mixi madaxu.<verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />E birin a falama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:5">‹Namiɲɔnmɛ mu n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:5">Kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui n xɛ nan tun safe.›<verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Kɔnɔ e a maxɔrinma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:6">‹Munse na yi nari ra i bɛlɛxɛe ma?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:6">A e yaabima nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:6">‹N xanuntenyi nan n maxɔnɔxi.›»<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />«Santidɛgɛma, keli n ma xuruse dɛmadonyi xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">keli mixi xili ma naxan na n sɛɛti ma.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">«Santidɛgɛma, xuruse dɛmadonyi faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">yɛxɛɛe rayensen yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">N fama nɛ yɛxɛɛyɔrɛe ɲaxankatade.»<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">«Ɲama dɔxɔ firin faxama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">kɔnɔ a dɔxɔ saxan nde baloma nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />N na dɔxɔ saxan nde sama nɛ tɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">n e raxunu alɔ gbeti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">N xa e mato alɔ xɛɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">A na n maxandi, n a xa duba suxuma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">N fama nɛ a masende, ‹N ma ɲama nan ya,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">a fan a masen, ‹Alatala nan muxu Marigi Ala ra.›»<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s">Alatala fa lɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Alatala xa lɔxɔɛ fafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:1">Wo yaxuie wo harige itaxunma nɛ e boore ma wo ya xɔri.<verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />N si birin malanma nɛ Darisalamu gere xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">E soma nɛ taa kui, e banxi kana, e dutun ginɛe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">E ɲama sɛɛti xaninma nɛ konyiya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">e boore sɛɛti lu taa kui.<verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Alatala kelima nɛ a sa na sie gere a gere ki ma.<verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Na lɔxɔɛ Ala tima nɛ Oliwi geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">naxan na Darisalamu ya ra sogetede mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">Oliwi geya ibɔɔma nɛ a tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">kelife sogetede han sogegorode.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">Gulunba luma nɛ geya firin tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">keren na kɔɔla ma, keren na yirefanyi ma.<verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Na tɛmui wo wo gima nɛ gulunba kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">n ma geyae tagi han Aseli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">Wo wo gima nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">alɔ wo wo gixi bɔxi xa sɛrɛnyi ya ra ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">Yudaya mangɛ Yusiya xa waxati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">Na tɛmui n Marigi Alatala fama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">a nun a xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe ra.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Na lɔxɔɛ, naiyalanyi mu luma duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:6">yanbasee xunuma nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Yanyi nun kɔɛ mu na na lɔxɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:7">Alatala nan na lɔxɔɛ mɔɔli kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:7">Kɔnɔ nunmare tɛmui naiyalanma nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Na lɔxɔɛ, kisi ye minima nɛ Darisalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:8">sɛɛti te sogetede baa mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:8">sɛɛti goro sogegorode baa mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:8">A minima nɛ soge fure nun ɲɛmɛ tɛmui.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />Alatala nan findima duniɲa birin mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:9">Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala nan keren fama batude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:9">a xili nan gbansan falama.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Darisalamu bɔxi rabilinyi birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">findima nɛ mɛrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">kelife Geba, sa dɔxɔ Rimɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">Darisalamu yirefanyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">Darisalamu xa fe itema nɛ, a xa nɔɛ fa yensen yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">kelife Bunyamin naadɛ ma, sa dɔxɔ naadɛ singe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">han tunxui naadɛ, han Xananɛli koore banxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">han mangɛ xa wɛni yailande.<verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Mixie sabatima nɛ taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:11">e mu halakima sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:11">Darisalamu luma nɛ bɔɲɛsa kui.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Alatala fama nɛ fure ɲaaxi sinde sie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">naxee Darisalamu gerexi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">E fate kiri birin bɔrɔma nɛ beenu e xa faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">E yae bɔrɔma nɛ e ya yili kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">e nɛnyi bɔrɔma nɛ e dɛ kui.<verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala mixie ya isoma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:13">e e boore suxu, e e boore bɔnbɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Yudayakae gere tima nɛ Darisalamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:14">E naafuli bama nɛ sie yi ra naxee na e rabilinyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:14">xɛɛma, gbeti, nun dugi gbegbe.<verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Na fure ɲaaxi mɔɔli nde fan sinma nɛ xuruse birin ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:15">soee, sofalee, ɲɔxɔmɛe.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Darisalamu yaxui naxee mu faxaxi na kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:16">nee luma nɛ te ra ɲɛ birin Mangɛ Alatala batude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:16">e xa Bage Ti Sali raba na.<verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Xa duniɲa xabilɛ nde tondi sigade Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:17">Mangɛ Alatala batude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:17">tunɛ mu sinma e xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Xa Misira xabilɛ nde tondi sigade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">tunɛ mu goroma mɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">Alatala xa fure ɲaaxi nan na ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">a naxan nagoro sie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">naxee tondixi sigade Bage Ti Sali rabade.<verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Alatala Misira nun si birin ɲaxankatama na ki nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:19">naxee tondi sigade Bage Ti Sali rabade.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Na lɔxɔɛ, birin findima Alatala gbe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">A fama nɛ sɛbɛde tɔlɔnyie ma naxee gbakuxi soee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">«Alatala gbe.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">Tunde naxee sube gbansan ɲinma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">nee sɛniyɛnma nɛ alɔ yirabasee</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">naxee rawalima sɛrɛxɛbade sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Tunde birin naxee na Darisalamu nun Yudaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">nee birin sɛniyɛnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">nee birin findima nɛ Mangɛ Alatala gbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">Mixi birin naxee fama sɛrɛxɛ bade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">nee fama nɛ tunde ndee ra alako e xa kuri so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">Na lɔxɔɛ, Kanaan kaafiri yo mu soma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">Mangɛ Alatala xa banxi kui.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>